        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Denies new soaps, creams, perfumes, tanning products, or recent significant sunburn. Patient asked whether herbal teas instead of coffee or working under fluorescent lights could contribute; clinician explained these are not causative for this pattern."
      }
